<p>Let’s do the same for the table Movies. You will note that we likely have to do some reoptimisation for this output to look okay on the screen. While the below output can be scrolled in the browser, this is not so simple in the command line interface…</p>
<div class="interactive-sql">
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb62"><pre class="sourceCode sql interactive code-with-copy"><code class="sourceCode sql"><span id="cb62-1"><a href="#cb62-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="kw">SELECT</span> <span class="op">*</span> <span class="kw">FROM</span> Movie <span class="kw">LIMIT</span> <span class="dv">10</span>;</span></code><button title="Copy to Clipboard" class="code-copy-button"><i class="bi"></i></button></pre></div>
</div>
