Fantasy                                   6.31109271523179
Film-Noir                                 7.63333333333333
Game-Show                                 2.9
History                                   7.08487804878049
Horror                                    5.83273381294964
Music                                     6.4061320754717
Musical                                   6.50757575757576
Mystery                                   6.48864097363083
News                                      7.53333333333333
Reality-TV                                4.75
Romance                                   6.4482224247949
Sci-Fi                                    6.27741407528641
Short                                     6.38
Sport                                     6.60276243093922
Thriller                                  6.31289398280803
War                                       7.07488151658767
Western                                   6.7031914893617</code></pre>
<p>We’re now pretty much there, and all that we need to do to close this off is to order by rating. We can do this with <code>ORDER BY</code>, taking care to denote <code>DESC</code>, as otherwise SQL will sort in ascending order (<code>ASC</code>) as its default behaviour.:</p>
<div class="interactive-sql">
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb76"><pre class="sourceCode sql interactive code-with-copy"><code class="sourceCode sql"><span id="cb76-1"><a href="#cb76-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="kw">SELECT</span> genre_label, <span class="fu">AVG</span>(imdb_score) <span class="kw">FROM</span> Genre <span class="kw">JOIN</span> Movie_Genre <span class="kw">USING</span>(genre_ID) <span class="kw">JOIN</span> Movie <span class="kw">USING</span>(movie_ID) <span class="kw">GROUP</span> <span class="kw">BY</span> genre_label <span class="kw">ORDER</span> <span class="kw">BY</span> <span class="fu">AVG</span>(imdb_score) <span class="kw">DESC</span>;</span></code><button title="Copy to Clipboard" class="code-copy-button"><i class="bi"></i></button></pre></div>
</div>
<pre><code>Film-Noir                                 7.63333333333333
News                                      7.53333333333333
Documentary                               7.1801652892562
